 "description": "Look up NestCalc's independent Deal Score for a for-sale listing, or list the current top deals (WINs) in a covered city. Scores are published for every listing, including low ones, and are never changed for anyone. Covered today: Cincinnati. For any other property, use analyze_rental. Not an appraisal.",
